  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "はなのミツや　かふんが　エサ。\nオーラを　かんじる　ちからを　もち\nさきそうな　はなを　みわけている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "꽃의 꿀이나 꽃가루가 먹이다.\n오라를 느끼는 힘을 지니고 있어\n필 것 같은 꽃을 구별한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "花蜜和花粉是牠的食物。\n擁有感知氣場的力量，\n能分辨出要綻放的花。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il se nourrit du nectar et du pollen des fleurs.\nAyant la capacité de percevoir l’aura des\nchoses, il sait quelles fleurs vont bientôt éclore.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ernährt sich von Blütenstaub und Honig. Da\nes die Aura von Lebewesen wahrnehmen kann,\nspürt es, wenn eine Blume bald blühen wird.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se alimenta de néctar y polen. Es capaz de\ndetectar los capullos que están a punto de\nabrirse.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si nutre di nettare e polline. È in grado di\npercepire l’aura di tutte le cose intorno a sé\ne avverte quando un fiore sta per sbocciare.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It feeds on the nectar and pollen of flowers.\nBecause it’s able to sense auras, it can identify\nwhich flowers are about to bloom.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "花のミツや　花粉が　餌。\nオーラを　感じる　力を　持ち\n咲きそうな　花を　見分けている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "花蜜和花粉是它的食物。\n拥有感知气场的力量，\n能分辨出要开放的花。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se alimenta de néctar y polen. Es capaz de\ndetectar los capullos que están a punto de\nabrirse.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "はなに　にた　オーラを　もつ　ひとの\nあたまの　うえには　たくさんの\nアブリーが　あつまってくるよ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "꽃을 닮은 오라를 가진 사람의\n머리 위에는 많은\n에블리가 모여든다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "擁有像花一般氣場的人，\n頭上會有許多萌虻聚集過來哦。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ils volettent gaiement en nombre au-dessus de\nla tête de certaines personnes dont l’aura\ns’apparenterait à celle d’une fleur.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Über den Köpfen von Menschen, deren Auren\ndenen von Blumen gleichen, finden sich\nzahlreich Wommel ein.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Revolotean en bandadas en torno a la cabeza de\naquellas personas que cuentan con un aura\nsimilar a la de las flores.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Svolazzano numerosi sulla testa di persone\nche emanano un’aura somigliante in qualche\nmodo a quella dei fiori.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Myriads of Cutiefly flutter above the heads of\npeople who have auras resembling those\nof flowers.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "花に　似た　オーラを　持つ　人の\n頭の　上には　たくさんの\nアブリーが　集まってくるよ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "拥有像花一样的气场的人，\n头上会有许多萌虻聚集过来哦。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Revolotean en bandadas en torno a la cabeza de\naquellas personas que cuentan con un aura\nsimilar a la de las flores.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "はなのミツと　かふんが　こうぶつ。\nはなばたけで　エサを　めぐり\nバタフリーと　こぜりあいをしている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "꽃의 꿀과 화분을 좋아한다.\n꽃밭에서 먹이를 두고\n버터플과 옥신각신한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "喜歡吃花蜜和花粉。\n經常在花圃裡為了爭奪食物\n而和巴大蝶發生小衝突。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il aime le nectar et le pollen, et se dispute\nces denrées avec Papilusion dans les champs\nde fleurs.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es liebt Blütenstaub und Nektar. Schwirrt es auf\nder Suche nach Futter durch Blumenbeete,\nhandelt es sich oft Reibereien mit Smettbo ein.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le encanta el néctar y el polen. Revolotea en\nbusca de alimento por campos de flores, donde\ntiene sus rifirrafes con Butterfree.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Adora il nettare e il polline.\nLo si vede spesso nei prati mentre bisticcia\ncon i Butterfree per accaparrarsi il cibo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nectar and pollen are its favorite fare. In fields\nof flowers, it gets into skirmishes with\nButterfree over food.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "花のミツと　花粉が　好物。\n花畑で　エサを　巡り\nバタフリーと　小競り合いをしている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "喜欢吃花蜜和花粉。\n会在花圃里寻找食物，\n和巴大蝶展开小冲突。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le encanta el néctar y el polen. Revolotea en\nbusca de alimento por campos de flores, donde\ntiene sus rifirrafes con Butterfree.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
