        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "いきものの　オーラを　かんじとる。\nオーラから　うごきを　さきよみ　して\nてきを　ほんろう　するのが　とくい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "생물의 오라를 느낀다.\n오라를 통해 움직임을 먼저 읽어서\n적을 농락하는 것이 특기다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "能夠感知生物的氣場。\n擅長透過氣場預先判斷\n敵人的行動並玩弄對方。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il perçoit l’aura des êtres vivants, ce qui lui\npermet de se jouer de son adversaire en\nprévoyant et en anticipant ses mouvements.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es kann die Aura von Lebewesen wahrnehmen.\nSo erahnt es die Bewegungen seiner Feinde und\nkann sie geschickt an der Nase herumführen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Percibe el aura de los seres vivos. Aprovecha\nesta capacidad para juguetear con el enemigo\nanticipándose a sus movimientos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Percepisce l’aura degli esseri viventi, riuscendo\ncosì ad anticipare i loro movimenti. Per questo\nha sempre la meglio sui nemici.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
